@baseUrl = https://localhost:5001
@provider = company
@ticket = replace-with-ticket-from-callback
@accessToken = replace-with-developer-access-token

### Read provider settings; requires Configuration.Read, client secrets are never returned
GET {{baseUrl}}/settings/security.json/oidc
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Save provider settings; requires Configuration.Manage, replaces the configured provider list
PUT {{baseUrl}}/settings/security.json/oidc
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ticketLifetime": "00:02:00",
  "authenticationTimeout": "00:10:00",
  "maxPendingTickets": 1000,
  "providers": []
}

### List configured providers without secrets
GET {{baseUrl}}/sign/in/oidc/providers

### Start sign-in in a browser; retain cookies through callback and redemption
GET {{baseUrl}}/sign/in/oidc/{{provider}}

### The provider redirects to this registered callback; code and state are provider-issued
POST {{baseUrl}}/sign/in/oidc/callback/{{provider}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

code=provider-issued-code&state=protected-state-from-challenge

### Redeem once, with the browser-binding cookie set by the challenge
POST {{baseUrl}}/sign/in/oidc/redeem
Content-Type: application/json

{"ticket": "{{ticket}}"}

### Unknown provider: 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/sign/in/oidc/unknown

### Unbound or invalid ticket: 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/sign/in/oidc/redeem
Content-Type: application/json

{"ticket": "invalid"}
